Moldable Otto library (otto_fit.scad, otto_core.scad, otto_shells.scad) and the
Otto geometry exported from it.

Based on Otto DIY by Camilo Parra Palacio and the Otto DIY team / HP Robots
(https://www.ottodiy.com), licensed under Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International. Changes: newly authored OpenSCAD
geometry following Otto V9 proportions, parametric exterior styles, and a
Moldable fit core.

